{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/75c6e7e020e8cd6ff70e2a1226ca7f83.avif?t=1774418965\" width=1079 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where civilization is controlled by alien gods, the resources people need to survive are all in the hands of the alien &quot;divine messengers.&quot; One day, one of the last remaining kingdoms on the continent, &quot;White Crown,&quot; secretly created an artificial human with memories not of this world. And so... the story begins -- -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/0ad1aaa3ff7afd5e28548dbfb2774461.avif?t=1774418965\" width=1079 height=117 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a world that has experienced the end of the world, been saved and transformed by the &quot;alien gods.&quot; To test whether this world is worthy of survival, the gods demand that qualified &quot;mecha competitors&quot; stage battles to please them. However -- Among the many rewards for the victors -- Knowledge alone is forbidden. The invisible hand stifles the growth of civilization. Like the spiral symbolizing dialectical development and self - breakthrough, it loses the final impetus of negation of negation. Only by breaking free from the shackles and standing before the &quot;alien gods&quot; can one understand the truth behind all events. -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/e6b404055dac0a88f06ac893d9230540.avif?t=1774418965\" width=1090 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/25daf088855d7b15001b363ccfbb053e.avif?t=1774418965\" width=1079 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. A combination of visual novels and motion effects, with an abundance of rich visual performances, and a script content of over 400,000 words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/6d418d14e70998df46e5410f38d7cd8e.poster.avif?t=1774418965\" width=1058 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/6d418d14e70998df46e5410f38d7cd8e.webm?t=1774418965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/6d418d14e70998df46e5410f38d7cd8e.mp4?t=1774418965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. A turn - based RPG battle game with rich frame - by - frame animation performances (the engine/UI is under development, and the preview images are not the final quality).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/c845bfb9155f082df7d51bd7985f8fd7.poster.avif?t=1774418965\" width=796 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/c845bfb9155f082df7d51bd7985f8fd7.webm?t=1774418965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877130/extras/c845bfb9155f082df7d51bd7985f8fd7.mp4?t=1774418965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Regular RPG gameplay, map pre